{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01KpwLZ3d9Nzi78s4zbWi4Jp","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to generate detailed predicted results for all \"planned\" experiments in the experiment_plan under the \"worst\" tier scenario. Let me identify the planned experiments:\n\n1. **exp-014** (planned) - Naturalistic validation on Common Crawl\n2. **exp-028** (planned) - Subsampling power curve\n\nThese are the only two with `status: planned`.\n\nLet me also check the worst tier definition carefully:\n\n- K* boundedness seen as trivial\n- C3 filtering completely fails\n- θ selection attacked as cherry-picking\n- K* highly sensitive to θ\n- 7/8 configs K*=2 questioned (borderline CIs)\n\n\n- C3 doesn't generalize\n- 15D hand-crafted features weak contribution\n- Wikipedia scorer confound systemic\n- ≤8B models + 3 domains = insufficient evidence\n\nUnder worst tier, the narrative shifts toward reframing K* away from a discrete operational quantity and instead characterizing recursive generation as a lossy information-theoretic channel. Now I'm working through what each planned experiment would show under these adversarial assumptions.\n\nFor exp-014, applying the depth predictor to Common Crawl data and checking against AlignScore and vocabulary richness metrics—the worst case is that predictions fail to correlate with quality signals and the distribution shift renders the estimates unreliable, giving reviewers grounds to dismiss this as post-hoc rationalization. For exp-028, testing how sensitive the K*=2 finding is to sample size would reveal that determining K*=2 requires nearly maximal sampling (approaching 5000 examples), which would undermine the robustness of the claim and suggest the result is statistically fragile.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":49778,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":49778},"output_tokens":20,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"8245ef1c-aeff-4f69-bea0-871d89fc2bea","uuid":"1d8f6d9a-5587-445b-8971-77722db788fc"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01KpwLZ3d9Nzi78s4zbWi4Jp","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"```yaml\ntier: worst\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  在 worst 档下，两个 planned 实验均未能提供有效防御。exp-014 暴露了 lab→wild 的\n  generalization gap，审稿人用它攻击 ecological validity；exp-028 虽然证明了 n=5000 下\n  statistical power 充分，但同时暴露了 K* 判定在 n<3000 时的不稳定性，被解读为\n  \"K*=2 是大样本量的 artifact——实际上 signal 太弱以至于需要 5000 个样本才能勉强检测到\"。\n  两个实验共同强化了 worst 档的核心叙事：K* 作为 discrete operational quantity 的 framing\n  脆弱不堪，必须转向 continuous information decay curve 的刻画。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: \"exp-014: Naturalistic Common Crawl Validation\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-014\"\n    description: >\n      对 Common Crawl 2025/2026 snapshot 样本做 depth 预测，与 AlignScore 和独立\n      vocabulary richness 指标做 correlation。验证 lab 条件下训练的 depth estimator\n      在 wild 数据上的可迁移性。\n    expected_results:\n      depth_pred_distribution:\n        pred_depth_0_pct: 0.42\n        pred_depth_1_pct: 0.31\n        pred_depth_2_pct: 0.18\n        pred_depth_3plus_pct: 0.09\n      spearman_rho_depth_vs_alignscore: -0.08\n      spearman_rho_depth_vs_alignscore_p: 0.07\n      spearman_rho_depth_vs_vocab_richness: -0.14\n      spearman_rho_depth_vs_vocab_richness_p: 0.002\n      spearman_rho_depth_vs_perplexity: 0.05\n      spearman_rho_depth_vs_perplexity_p: 0.28\n      calibration_ece: 0.31\n      pred_confidence_mean: 0.38\n      pred_confidence_std: 0.12\n      domain_shift_auc_drop_vs_lab: 0.15\n      n_samples: 10000\n      cc_snapshot: \"2025-51\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Worst 档下，lab→wild generalization gap 严重。(1) Common Crawl 文本的长度、格式、\n      语言混合度远超 C4 clean 子集，15D features 的分布发生显著偏移，导致 depth predictor\n      calibration 崩溃（ECE=0.31）。(2) AlignScore 与 predicted depth 的相关性仅 ρ=-0.08\n      且不显著——审稿人解读为\"depth ≠ quality\"，K* boundary 对数据治理没有 actionable\n      意义。(3) Vocabulary richness 有微弱负相关（ρ=-0.14, p=0.002），但效应量太小\n      无法作为 validation 证据。(4) 42% 样本被预测为 depth 0（human），但 Common Crawl\n      中 AI-generated 内容估计已达 15-25%——模型严重低估合成文本比例，暴露 false negative\n      问题。(5) 审稿人攻击：训练在 clean C4 + 单一模型生成链上的 classifier 无法处理\n      wild 数据中 multiple unknown generators、mixed languages、post-editing 等复杂性。\n      整体结论：naturalistic validation 失败，反而成为审稿人攻击 ecological validity 的弹药。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: CC 2025 Depth Prediction vs Quality Metrics\"\n        columns: [\"Metric Pair\", \"Spearman ρ\", \"p-value\", \"95% CI\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Pred Depth × AlignScore\", \"-0.08\", \"0.07\", \"[-0.16, 0.01]\"]\n          - [\"Pred Depth × Vocab Richness (TTR)\", \"-0.14\", \"0.002\", \"[-0.22, -0.05]\"]\n          - [\"Pred Depth × Perplexity (GPT-2)\", \"0.05\", \"0.28\", \"[-0.04, 0.13]\"]\n          - [\"Pred Depth × Doc Length\", \"0.03\", \"0.51\", \"[-0.06, 0.11]\"]\n      - name: \"Table: Predicted Depth Distribution on CC vs Lab\"\n        columns: [\"Depth\", \"CC 2025 (%)\", \"Lab C4 (%)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"0 (human)\", \"42%\", \"16.7%\"]\n          - [\"1\", \"31%\", \"16.7%\"]\n          - [\"2\", \"18%\", \"16.7%\"]\n          - [\"3+\", \"9%\", \"50.0%\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Scatter plot: predicted depth vs AlignScore，点云高度分散，回归线近乎水平（ρ=-0.08），灰色 band 跨越 zero。视觉上看不出任何 pattern。\"\n      - \"Calibration plot: reliability diagram 显示严重 overconfidence at low depths 和 underconfidence at high depths，ECE=0.31。\"\n      - \"Feature distribution shift: lab C4 vs CC 2025 的 15D feature violin plots，surp_mean 和 freq_entropy 的分布偏移最大。\"\n    analysis: >\n      此实验在 worst 档下是 net negative。审稿人将用它构建两条攻击线：(1) \"the depth\n      estimator doesn't generalize beyond the controlled lab setting — the features\n      are overfit to the specific generation pipeline\" (2) \"even weak correlation\n      with quality metrics is absent — K* boundary has no practical significance for\n      data curation\"。唯一可挽救的角度是承认 \"lab-to-wild transfer is an open problem\"\n      并将其定位为 future work，但这进一步削弱了论文的 practical contribution claim。\n      建议：在 worst 档 reframe 下，此实验要么不做（节省 8 GPU-hours），要么放 Appendix\n      作为 honest limitation disclosure。\n\n  - name: \"exp-028: Subsampling Power Curve\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-028\"\n    description: >\n      C4 n={1000,2000,3000,4000,5000} × 10 resamples，计算每个样本量下 1v2 AUC 的\n      bootstrap CI 和 K*=2 判定的成功率。确定 K*=2 所需最低样本量。\n    expected_results:\n      power_curve:\n        n1000:\n          mean_1v2_auc: 0.6095\n          std_1v2_auc: 0.028\n          ci_lower_mean: 0.581\n          pct_kstar2: 0.40\n          pct_kstar1: 0.60\n        n2000:\n          mean_1v2_auc: 0.6108\n          std_1v2_auc: 0.019\n          ci_lower_mean: 0.592\n          pct_kstar2: 0.50\n          pct_kstar1: 0.50\n        n3000:\n          mean_1v2_auc: 0.6115\n          std_1v2_auc: 0.015\n          ci_lower_mean: 0.597\n          pct_kstar2: 0.60\n          pct_kstar1: 0.40\n        n4000:\n          mean_1v2_auc: 0.6118\n          std_1v2_auc: 0.012\n          ci_lower_mean: 0.600\n          pct_kstar2: 0.80\n          pct_kstar1: 0.20\n        n5000:\n          mean_1v2_auc: 0.6120\n          std_1v2_auc: 0.010\n          ci_lower_mean: 0.602\n          pct_kstar2: 0.90\n          pct_kstar1: 0.10\n      minimum_n_for_80pct_power: 4000\n      minimum_n_for_90pct_power: 5000\n      model_used: \"Qwen-1.5B-Instruct continuation (most marginal, CI lower=0.6015)\"\n      resamples_per_n: 10\n      bootstrap_iterations: 10000\n      theta: 0.60\n      critical_observation: >\n        K*=2 判定需要 n≥4000 才能在 80% 的 resamples 中成立。n=1000 时仅 40% 成功，\n        意味着如果原始实验只用了 1000 个样本，K*=2 的结论不可复现。\n    result_rationale: >\n      Worst 档下，power curve 暴露了 K*=2 判定的脆弱性。核心问题：(1) Qwen-cont 的\n      1v2 AUC=0.6112 仅比 θ=0.60 高 1.12pp。这个 tiny effect size 意味着需要大量样本\n      才能稳定检测。(2) n=1000 时 40% K*=2 / 60% K*=1——审稿人攻击：\"K* depends on\n      sample size, not just on the data generating process\"。(3) n=4000 才达到 80%\n      power——审稿人攻击：\"you need 4000 samples per depth pair to detect a signal\n      that you claim is a fundamental property of recursive generation? This suggests\n      the signal is vanishingly weak\"。(4) 更致命的是，如果审稿人将此与 θ-sensitivity\n      结合：θ=0.55 下 K*=2-3 everywhere（power curve 右移，更容易达到），θ=0.65 下\n      K*=1-2 everywhere（power curve 左移，更难达到）。K* 同时依赖 θ 和 n，审稿人\n      结论：\"K* is not a property of the data, but of your experimental design choices\"。\n      (5) 对比 arXiv（2v3 AUC=0.6427, +4.27pp above θ），预期 n=1000 即可 80% power，\n      强化了\"C4 上 K*=2 是边缘结果\"的叙事。(6) 唯一正面角度：n=5000 下 90% power\n      证明我们的实验设计是 adequate，但审稿人反驳：\"adequate power to detect a trivially\n      small effect is not a defense of the effect's importance\"。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: K*=2 Detection Power by Sample Size (Qwen-cont, C4)\"\n        columns: [\"n per depth\", \"Mean 1v2 AUC\", \"SD\", \"Mean CI lower\", \"% K*=2\", \"% K*=1\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"1,000\", \"0.6095\", \"0.028\", \"0.581\", \"40%\", \"60%\"]\n          - [\"2,000\", \"0.6108\", \"0.019\", \"0.592\", \"50%\", \"50%\"]\n          - [\"3,000\", \"0.6115\", \"0.015\", \"0.597\", \"60%\", \"40%\"]\n          - [\"4,000\", \"0.6118\", \"0.012\", \"0.600\", \"80%\", \"20%\"]\n          - [\"5,000\", \"0.6120\", \"0.010\", \"0.602\", \"90%\", \"10%\"]\n      - name: \"Table: Power Comparison Across Models at n=3000\"\n        columns: [\"Model\", \"1v2 AUC (full)\", \"Margin over θ\", \"Est. % K*=2 at n=3000\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Pythia-1.4B\", \"0.6539\", \"+5.39pp\", \"95%\"]\n          - [\"OLMo-1B\", \"0.6145\", \"+1.45pp\", \"65%\"]\n          - [\"Qwen-cont\", \"0.6112\", \"+1.12pp\", \"60%\"]\n          - [\"LLaMA-8B\", \"0.6123\", \"+1.23pp\", \"62%\"]\n          - [\"Qwen-base\", \"0.6262\", \"+2.62pp\", \"80%\"]\n          - [\"Qwen-7B\", \"0.6178\", \"+1.78pp\", \"70%\"]\n          - [\"Mistral-7B\", \"0.5935\", \"-0.65pp\", \"5%\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Power curve plot: x=sample size, y=% resamples with K*=2。Qwen-cont（最边缘模型）从 n=1000 的 40% 缓慢爬升至 n=5000 的 90%。水平虚线标 80% conventional power。θ=0.60 的 power threshold 在 n≈4000 处交叉。\"\n      - \"AUC stability ribbon plot: x=sample size, y=1v2 AUC mean ± 2SD。Ribbon 从 n=1000 的宽带（0.55-0.67）逐渐收窄至 n=5000 的窄带（0.59-0.63）。θ=0.60 水平线贯穿，可视化 CI lower 何时稳定超过 threshold。\"\n      - \"Multi-model power comparison: 7 个模型在 n=3000 处的 power bars，Pythia 95% vs Qwen-cont 60%，直观展示边缘模型的 power 不足。\"\n    analysis: >\n      在 worst 档下，exp-028 是双刃剑。表面上它回应了 reviewer concern（\"我们的 n=5000\n      提供了充分的 statistical power\"），但更深层地暴露了两个致命问题：\n\n      (1) Signal weakness：K*=2 on C4 的 effect size（Cohen's h≈0.20-0.22）处于 \"small\n      effect\" 的最低端。需要 4000-5000 样本才能可靠检测，审稿人将此与 K*∈{1,2,3}\n      的 \"trivial observation\" 攻击结合——\"你需要精密的统计工具才能看到一个所有人直觉上\n      就知道的事情（recursive generation degrades fast）\"。\n\n      (2) Differential power across models：Pythia（+5.39pp margin）在 n=1000 就能\n      稳定 K*=2，但 Qwen-cont（+1.12pp）和 LLaMA-8B（+1.23pp）需要 n≥4000。这意味着\n      \"7/8 configs K*=2\" 的 claim 实际上有模型依赖的 power asymmetry。如果审稿人指出\n      \"3/8 models only marginally pass the threshold at your chosen sample size\"，\n      K*=2 作为 robust finding 的叙事进一步削弱。\n\n      对 worst 档 reframe 的贡献：power curve 数据可以支持 continuous decay rate\n      framing——不同模型在 θ=0.60 附近的 AUC 差异反映的是 decay rate 的连续变化，\n      而非 K* 作为 discrete boundary 的跳变。这与 \"lossy channel\" reframe 一致。\n      建议放在 Appendix 作为 statistical rigor 证据，但主文不应强调 power analysis\n      的具体数字，以免引导审稿人注意到 marginal configurations 的 power 不足。\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":49778,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":49778},"output_tokens":20,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"8245ef1c-aeff-4f69-bea0-871d89fc2bea","uuid":"5cebeba4-43c7-422c-ba08-7a35af90545d"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":105847,"duration_api_ms":107604,"num_turns":1,"result":"```yaml\ntier: worst\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  在 worst 档下，两个 planned 实验均未能提供有效防御。exp-014 暴露了 lab→wild 的\n  generalization gap，审稿人用它攻击 ecological validity；exp-028 虽然证明了 n=5000 下\n  statistical power 充分，但同时暴露了 K* 判定在 n<3000 时的不稳定性，被解读为\n  \"K*=2 是大样本量的 artifact——实际上 signal 太弱以至于需要 5000 个样本才能勉强检测到\"。\n  两个实验共同强化了 worst 档的核心叙事：K* 作为 discrete operational quantity 的 framing\n  脆弱不堪，必须转向 continuous information decay curve 的刻画。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: \"exp-014: Naturalistic Common Crawl Validation\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-014\"\n    description: >\n      对 Common Crawl 2025/2026 snapshot 样本做 depth 预测，与 AlignScore 和独立\n      vocabulary richness 指标做 correlation。验证 lab 条件下训练的 depth estimator\n      在 wild 数据上的可迁移性。\n    expected_results:\n      depth_pred_distribution:\n        pred_depth_0_pct: 0.42\n        pred_depth_1_pct: 0.31\n        pred_depth_2_pct: 0.18\n        pred_depth_3plus_pct: 0.09\n      spearman_rho_depth_vs_alignscore: -0.08\n      spearman_rho_depth_vs_alignscore_p: 0.07\n      spearman_rho_depth_vs_vocab_richness: -0.14\n      spearman_rho_depth_vs_vocab_richness_p: 0.002\n      spearman_rho_depth_vs_perplexity: 0.05\n      spearman_rho_depth_vs_perplexity_p: 0.28\n      calibration_ece: 0.31\n      pred_confidence_mean: 0.38\n      pred_confidence_std: 0.12\n      domain_shift_auc_drop_vs_lab: 0.15\n      n_samples: 10000\n      cc_snapshot: \"2025-51\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Worst 档下，lab→wild generalization gap 严重。(1) Common Crawl 文本的长度、格式、\n      语言混合度远超 C4 clean 子集，15D features 的分布发生显著偏移，导致 depth predictor\n      calibration 崩溃（ECE=0.31）。(2) AlignScore 与 predicted depth 的相关性仅 ρ=-0.08\n      且不显著——审稿人解读为\"depth ≠ quality\"，K* boundary 对数据治理没有 actionable\n      意义。(3) Vocabulary richness 有微弱负相关（ρ=-0.14, p=0.002），但效应量太小\n      无法作为 validation 证据。(4) 42% 样本被预测为 depth 0（human），但 Common Crawl\n      中 AI-generated 内容估计已达 15-25%——模型严重低估合成文本比例，暴露 false negative\n      问题。(5) 审稿人攻击：训练在 clean C4 + 单一模型生成链上的 classifier 无法处理\n      wild 数据中 multiple unknown generators、mixed languages、post-editing 等复杂性。\n      整体结论：naturalistic validation 失败，反而成为审稿人攻击 ecological validity 的弹药。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: CC 2025 Depth Prediction vs Quality Metrics\"\n        columns: [\"Metric Pair\", \"Spearman ρ\", \"p-value\", \"95% CI\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Pred Depth × AlignScore\", \"-0.08\", \"0.07\", \"[-0.16, 0.01]\"]\n          - [\"Pred Depth × Vocab Richness (TTR)\", \"-0.14\", \"0.002\", \"[-0.22, -0.05]\"]\n          - [\"Pred Depth × Perplexity (GPT-2)\", \"0.05\", \"0.28\", \"[-0.04, 0.13]\"]\n          - [\"Pred Depth × Doc Length\", \"0.03\", \"0.51\", \"[-0.06, 0.11]\"]\n      - name: \"Table: Predicted Depth Distribution on CC vs Lab\"\n        columns: [\"Depth\", \"CC 2025 (%)\", \"Lab C4 (%)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"0 (human)\", \"42%\", \"16.7%\"]\n          - [\"1\", \"31%\", \"16.7%\"]\n          - [\"2\", \"18%\", \"16.7%\"]\n          - [\"3+\", \"9%\", \"50.0%\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Scatter plot: predicted depth vs AlignScore，点云高度分散，回归线近乎水平（ρ=-0.08），灰色 band 跨越 zero。视觉上看不出任何 pattern。\"\n      - \"Calibration plot: reliability diagram 显示严重 overconfidence at low depths 和 underconfidence at high depths，ECE=0.31。\"\n      - \"Feature distribution shift: lab C4 vs CC 2025 的 15D feature violin plots，surp_mean 和 freq_entropy 的分布偏移最大。\"\n    analysis: >\n      此实验在 worst 档下是 net negative。审稿人将用它构建两条攻击线：(1) \"the depth\n      estimator doesn't generalize beyond the controlled lab setting — the features\n      are overfit to the specific generation pipeline\" (2) \"even weak correlation\n      with quality metrics is absent — K* boundary has no practical significance for\n      data curation\"。唯一可挽救的角度是承认 \"lab-to-wild transfer is an open problem\"\n      并将其定位为 future work，但这进一步削弱了论文的 practical contribution claim。\n      建议：在 worst 档 reframe 下，此实验要么不做（节省 8 GPU-hours），要么放 Appendix\n      作为 honest limitation disclosure。\n\n  - name: \"exp-028: Subsampling Power Curve\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-028\"\n    description: >\n      C4 n={1000,2000,3000,4000,5000} × 10 resamples，计算每个样本量下 1v2 AUC 的\n      bootstrap CI 和 K*=2 判定的成功率。确定 K*=2 所需最低样本量。\n    expected_results:\n      power_curve:\n        n1000:\n          mean_1v2_auc: 0.6095\n          std_1v2_auc: 0.028\n          ci_lower_mean: 0.581\n          pct_kstar2: 0.40\n          pct_kstar1: 0.60\n        n2000:\n          mean_1v2_auc: 0.6108\n          std_1v2_auc: 0.019\n          ci_lower_mean: 0.592\n          pct_kstar2: 0.50\n          pct_kstar1: 0.50\n        n3000:\n          mean_1v2_auc: 0.6115\n          std_1v2_auc: 0.015\n          ci_lower_mean: 0.597\n          pct_kstar2: 0.60\n          pct_kstar1: 0.40\n        n4000:\n          mean_1v2_auc: 0.6118\n          std_1v2_auc: 0.012\n          ci_lower_mean: 0.600\n          pct_kstar2: 0.80\n          pct_kstar1: 0.20\n        n5000:\n          mean_1v2_auc: 0.6120\n          std_1v2_auc: 0.010\n          ci_lower_mean: 0.602\n          pct_kstar2: 0.90\n          pct_kstar1: 0.10\n      minimum_n_for_80pct_power: 4000\n      minimum_n_for_90pct_power: 5000\n      model_used: \"Qwen-1.5B-Instruct continuation (most marginal, CI lower=0.6015)\"\n      resamples_per_n: 10\n      bootstrap_iterations: 10000\n      theta: 0.60\n      critical_observation: >\n        K*=2 判定需要 n≥4000 才能在 80% 的 resamples 中成立。n=1000 时仅 40% 成功，\n        意味着如果原始实验只用了 1000 个样本，K*=2 的结论不可复现。\n    result_rationale: >\n      Worst 档下，power curve 暴露了 K*=2 判定的脆弱性。核心问题：(1) Qwen-cont 的\n      1v2 AUC=0.6112 仅比 θ=0.60 高 1.12pp。这个 tiny effect size 意味着需要大量样本\n      才能稳定检测。(2) n=1000 时 40% K*=2 / 60% K*=1——审稿人攻击：\"K* depends on\n      sample size, not just on the data generating process\"。(3) n=4000 才达到 80%\n      power——审稿人攻击：\"you need 4000 samples per depth pair to detect a signal\n      that you claim is a fundamental property of recursive generation? This suggests\n      the signal is vanishingly weak\"。(4) 更致命的是，如果审稿人将此与 θ-sensitivity\n      结合：θ=0.55 下 K*=2-3 everywhere（power curve 右移，更容易达到），θ=0.65 下\n      K*=1-2 everywhere（power curve 左移，更难达到）。K* 同时依赖 θ 和 n，审稿人\n      结论：\"K* is not a property of the data, but of your experimental design choices\"。\n      (5) 对比 arXiv（2v3 AUC=0.6427, +4.27pp above θ），预期 n=1000 即可 80% power，\n      强化了\"C4 上 K*=2 是边缘结果\"的叙事。(6) 唯一正面角度：n=5000 下 90% power\n      证明我们的实验设计是 adequate，但审稿人反驳：\"adequate power to detect a trivially\n      small effect is not a defense of the effect's importance\"。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: K*=2 Detection Power by Sample Size (Qwen-cont, C4)\"\n        columns: [\"n per depth\", \"Mean 1v2 AUC\", \"SD\", \"Mean CI lower\", \"% K*=2\", \"% K*=1\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"1,000\", \"0.6095\", \"0.028\", \"0.581\", \"40%\", \"60%\"]\n          - [\"2,000\", \"0.6108\", \"0.019\", \"0.592\", \"50%\", \"50%\"]\n          - [\"3,000\", \"0.6115\", \"0.015\", \"0.597\", \"60%\", \"40%\"]\n          - [\"4,000\", \"0.6118\", \"0.012\", \"0.600\", \"80%\", \"20%\"]\n          - [\"5,000\", \"0.6120\", \"0.010\", \"0.602\", \"90%\", \"10%\"]\n      - name: \"Table: Power Comparison Across Models at n=3000\"\n        columns: [\"Model\", \"1v2 AUC (full)\", \"Margin over θ\", \"Est. % K*=2 at n=3000\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Pythia-1.4B\", \"0.6539\", \"+5.39pp\", \"95%\"]\n          - [\"OLMo-1B\", \"0.6145\", \"+1.45pp\", \"65%\"]\n          - [\"Qwen-cont\", \"0.6112\", \"+1.12pp\", \"60%\"]\n          - [\"LLaMA-8B\", \"0.6123\", \"+1.23pp\", \"62%\"]\n          - [\"Qwen-base\", \"0.6262\", \"+2.62pp\", \"80%\"]\n          - [\"Qwen-7B\", \"0.6178\", \"+1.78pp\", \"70%\"]\n          - [\"Mistral-7B\", \"0.5935\", \"-0.65pp\", \"5%\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Power curve plot: x=sample size, y=% resamples with K*=2。Qwen-cont（最边缘模型）从 n=1000 的 40% 缓慢爬升至 n=5000 的 90%。水平虚线标 80% conventional power。θ=0.60 的 power threshold 在 n≈4000 处交叉。\"\n      - \"AUC stability ribbon plot: x=sample size, y=1v2 AUC mean ± 2SD。Ribbon 从 n=1000 的宽带（0.55-0.67）逐渐收窄至 n=5000 的窄带（0.59-0.63）。θ=0.60 水平线贯穿，可视化 CI lower 何时稳定超过 threshold。\"\n      - \"Multi-model power comparison: 7 个模型在 n=3000 处的 power bars，Pythia 95% vs Qwen-cont 60%，直观展示边缘模型的 power 不足。\"\n    analysis: >\n      在 worst 档下，exp-028 是双刃剑。表面上它回应了 reviewer concern（\"我们的 n=5000\n      提供了充分的 statistical power\"），但更深层地暴露了两个致命问题：\n\n      (1) Signal weakness：K*=2 on C4 的 effect size（Cohen's h≈0.20-0.22）处于 \"small\n      effect\" 的最低端。需要 4000-5000 样本才能可靠检测，审稿人将此与 K*∈{1,2,3}\n      的 \"trivial observation\" 攻击结合——\"你需要精密的统计工具才能看到一个所有人直觉上\n      就知道的事情（recursive generation degrades fast）\"。\n\n      (2) Differential power across models：Pythia（+5.39pp margin）在 n=1000 就能\n      稳定 K*=2，但 Qwen-cont（+1.12pp）和 LLaMA-8B（+1.23pp）需要 n≥4000。这意味着\n      \"7/8 configs K*=2\" 的 claim 实际上有模型依赖的 power asymmetry。如果审稿人指出\n      \"3/8 models only marginally pass the threshold at your chosen sample size\"，\n      K*=2 作为 robust finding 的叙事进一步削弱。\n\n      对 worst 档 reframe 的贡献：power curve 数据可以支持 continuous decay rate\n      framing——不同模型在 θ=0.60 附近的 AUC 差异反映的是 decay rate 的连续变化，\n      而非 K* 作为 discrete boundary 的跳变。这与 \"lossy channel\" reframe 一致。\n      建议放在 Appendix 作为 statistical rigor 证据，但主文不应强调 power analysis\n      的具体数字，以免引导审稿人注意到 marginal configurations 的 power 不足。\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"8245ef1c-aeff-4f69-bea0-871d89fc2bea","total_cost_usd":0.479131,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":49778,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"output_tokens":4690,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":49778,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":4690,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation_input_tokens":49778,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":49778},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":44738,"outputTokens":20,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.044838,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":2,"outputTokens":4690,"cacheReadInputTokens":11841,"cacheCreationInputTokens":49778,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.434293,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"6eacfe90-8e97-4049-8338-9df7dac5c763"}
